<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 241 MLN WITH NBP.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 241 MLN WITH NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid to place 241 million zlotys, in nominal terms, at the National Bank of Poland's reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction against a one billion zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Banks also bid for 960 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills at the central bank's one billion zloty tender.</p>
<p>Results of the auctions should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
